  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Foundational Abstractions: Core interfaces for connection lifecycles and shared framework contracts used across all Nalix modules.\n- Networking Standards: Unified IPacket, IBufferLease, and protocol enums (CipherSuite, Snowflake) for consistent communication.\n- Memory & Concurrency: High-performance gating and memory-leasing primitives designed for low-allocation networking scenarios.\n- System Diagnostics: Flexible exception models and logging abstractions providing the base for framework-wide observability.",
